Dataset Access Instructions

Training Dataset:
ADNI
https://adni.loni.usc.edu

External Validation Dataset:
OASIS
https://www.oasis-brains.org

Preprocessing Pipeline

1. MRI Acquisition
2. Skull Stripping
3. Intensity Normalization
4. CLAHE Enhancement
5. Slice Extraction
6. Resizing to 224x224

Data redistribution is restricted by ADNI and OASIS licenses.

Researchers must obtain datasets directly from official repositories.
